OL,3,ARight-wing commentator Milo
OL,4,AYiannopoulos deported from US to UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FBritish right-wing political
OL,7,Fcommentator Milo Yiannopoulos has been
OL,8,Fdeported from the United States after
OL,9,Fbeing detained by Immigration and
OL,10,FCustoms Enforcement (ICE).
OL,12,FYiannopoulos, 41, a former editor of
OL,13,FBreitbart News and one time political
OL,14,Faide to rapper Kanye West, was deported
OL,15,Fon Friday, according to the Department
OL,16,Fof Homeland Security (DHS).
OL,18,FYiannopoulos, "an illegal alien from
OL,19,Fthe United Kingdom" had been sent "back
OL,20,Fto his home country", a DHS
OL,21,Fspokesperson said in a statement given
OL,22,Fto the BBC.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/37
